//! {{ crate_name }} - {{ crate_description }}
//!
//! A clap-noun-verb CLI built with the following architecture:
//!
//! ```text
//! ┌──────────────┐
//! │  CLI Layer   │  ← #[verb] attributes (thin, validation only)
//! └────────┬─────┘
//!          │
//! ┌────────▼──────────┐
//! │ Integration       │  ← Tera, file I/O, external services
//! └────────┬──────────┘
//!          │
//! ┌────────▼──────────┐
//! │  Domain Layer     │  ← Pure business logic (testable, reusable)
//! └──────────────────┘
//! ```
//!
//! ## Features
//!
//! - **Auto-Discovery**: Commands discovered via `#[verb]` macros
//! - **Type Inference**: Arguments inferred from function signatures
//! - **JSON Output**: All output serialized to JSON by default
//! - **Error Handling**: Structured error types with context
//! - **Testing**: Pure domain logic enables comprehensive unit tests

use clap_noun_verb::Result;

